Group F2: 0.0199; upper limit: 0.0199
dF1: 0.0020; dF2: 0.0100
Merit upper bound: 2.3987; gap: <0.0001
Maximum constraint residual: <0.0001

Continuous mating allocations
  Parent 1  Parent 2  Allocation   Merit
  1         2             0.0107  2.3328
