  comparator           metric      estimate           SE
4      Equal G1.selected.mean  1.953539e-02 0.0012363589
5      Equal G2.selected.mean  5.698354e-03 0.0020294291
6      Equal      G2.response -1.383703e-02 0.0016101313
7         G1 G1.selected.mean -3.593500e-04 0.0003930399
8         G1 G2.selected.mean -3.930633e-04 0.0005759057
9         G1      G2.response -3.371328e-05 0.0004931103
