The displayed results are conditional on the external inputs used in
this example. An \cde{optimal} status certifies the optimum for the
supplied scores and constraints. Another panel can require more search
or yield no feasible plan. Yield and index objectives retain their
respective effect scales. The normal selection approximation and
supplied marker effects remain assumptions even at an optimum.

